{"book":"proverbs","num":14,"verses":[{"en":"Every wise woman buildeth her house: but the foolish plucketh it down with her hands.","n":1,"sm":"E taitasi uma fafine popoto ma atiina ae lona fale; a o le fafine valea na te lepetia ai i ona lima.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"E"},{"en":"","sm":"taitasi"},{"en":"","sm":"uma"},{"en":"","sm":"fafine"},{"en":"","sm":"popoto"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"atiina"},{"en":"","sm":"ae"},{"en":"","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"fale;"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"fafine"},{"en":"","sm":"valea"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"lepetia"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"lima."}]},{"en":"He that walketh in his uprightness feareth the LORD: but he that is perverse in his ways despiseth him.","n":2,"sm":"O loo savali i lana amiotonu le ua mata'u i le ALII; a e faapiopio ona ala le ua ʻinoʻino ia te ia.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"loo"},{"en":"","sm":"savali"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"lana"},{"en":"","sm":"amiotonu"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"mata'u"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ALII;"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"faapiopio"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"ala"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ʻinoʻino"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"ia."}]},{"en":"In the mouth of the foolish is a rod of pride: but the lips of the wise shall preserve them.","n":3,"sm":"O loo i le gutu o le vale le sasa o le faamaualuga; a o laugutu o e popoto e leoleoina ai i latou.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"loo"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"gutu"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"vale"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"sasa"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"faamaualuga;"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"laugu